      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Matthias, \nThere are serious stability(hang/crash) risk in Android15-6.6 branch related to Thermal module and these patches are essential to pass our stability issues. \n\nLinux mainline/K6.6 branch already have these patches. \n\nCan you help suggest if any method or alternative approach to pass KMI checks?\ne.g. can we use ANDROID_KABI_RESERVE(1) for our completion field under \u0027thermal_zone_device\u0027 struct or some other method?\n\nPlease help for the same.\nThank you!",
